    "structured_prompt": "{\n  \"short_description\": \"A dynamic image featuring a woman on a futuristic motorcycle speeding along an elevated highway in a cyberpunk city at dusk. Her long, flowing hair, black with streaks of red, trails behind her, emphasizing motion. The city skyline, illuminated by countless lights, forms a dramatic backdrop, suggesting a high-tech, fast-paced urban environment. The motorcycle itself glows with neon blue accents, adding to the futuristic aesthetic.\",\n  \"objects\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"A woman with dark skin and striking features, focused intently on the road ahead. Her long hair, predominantly black with vibrant red streaks, streams dramatically behind her, indicating high speed.\",\n      \"location\": \"center-left\",\n      \"relationship\": \"The primary subject, riding the futuristic motorcycle.\",\n      \"relative_size\": \"large within frame\",\n      \"shape_and_color\": \"humanoid, dark skin, black and red hair\",\n      \"texture\": \"smooth skin, flowing hair, glossy suit\",\n      \"appearance_details\": \"Her eyes are fixed forward, conveying determination. Her hair is a prominent visual element, creating a sense of movement.\",\n      \"pose\": \"Leaning forward over the handlebars, body tucked in for aerodynamics.\",\n      \"expression\": \"Serious and focused.\",\n      \"clothing\": \"A sleek, form-fitting black suit with armored sections on the shoulders, elbows, and knees, suggesting protective gear.\",\n      \"action\": \"Riding a motorcycle at high speed.\",\n      \"gender\": \"female\",\n      \"skin_tone_and_texture\": \"medium-dark, smooth\",\n      \"orientation\": \"Facing forward and slightly to her right.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"A futuristic, sleek motorcycle with sharp angles and a metallic finish. It features glowing neon blue accents along its body, wheels, and undercarriage, suggesting advanced technology and speed.\",\n      \"location\": \"center-left\",\n