rms, dark grey/blue with numerous yellow/white lights\",\n      \"texture\": \"glass, concrete, metallic\",\n      \"appearance_details\": \"The lights within the buildings create a sense of depth and activity in the city.\",\n      \"orientation\": \"Vertical, extending upwards from the horizon.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Small, dark, flying vehicles, possibly drones or futuristic cars, scattered across the sky.\",\n      \"location\": \"top-left and top-right background\",\n      \"relationship\": \"They are part of the futuristic cityscape, adding to the sense of advanced technology and movement in the air.\",\n      \"relative_size\": \"small\",\n      \"shape_and_color\": \"small, dark, indistinct shapes\",\n      \"texture\": \"smooth\",\n      \"appearance_details\": \"Barely visible, they suggest a busy aerial space.\",\n      \"number_of_objects\": 5,\n      \"orientation\": \"Various, flying horizontally.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"background_setting\": \"A sprawling, futuristic cyberpunk city at dusk or early night, with towering skyscrapers illuminated by countless lights. The sky is a deep twilight blue, transitioning to warmer hues near the horizon. The city appears vast and technologically advanced, with a sense of constant activity.\",\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"conditions\": \"Dusk/night, artificial city lights\",\n    \"direction\": \"Ambient light from city buildings and the glowing elements of the motorcycle and highway. Some light appears to come from the horizon.\",\n    \"shadows\": \"Soft, diffused shadows, primarily under the motorcycle and rider, consistent with ambient city lighting and the time of day.\"\n  },\n  \"aesthetics\": {\n    \"composition\": \"Dynamic diagonal composition, with the highway and motorcycle creating strong leading lines from the foreground to the midground. The subject is slightly off-center, following the rule of thirds for visual interest.\",\n    \"color_scheme\": \"Cool blues and greys dominate, contrasted by warm yellow/orange lights from the city and the vibrant red in the woman's hair. Neon blue accents provide a futuristic glow.\",\n    \"mood_atmosphere\": \"Energetic, futuristic, adventurous, and slightly mysterious.\",\n    \"aesthetic_score\": \"very high\",\n    \"preference_score\": \"very high\"\n  },\n  \"photographic_characteristics\": {\n    \"depth_of_field\": \"Medium to deep, with the foreground motorcycle and rider in sharp focus, and the background city slightly less defined but still clear.\",\n    \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the subject (woman and motorcycle).\",\n    \"camera_angle\": \"Eye-level, slightly below the subject, giving a sense of speed and power.\",\n    \"lens_focal_length\": \"Standard lens (e.g., 35mm-50mm)\"\n  },\n  \"style_medium\": \"digital illustration\",\n  \"context\": \"This is a concept art piece for a futuristic action game or film, showcasing a powerful female protagonist in a high-tech urban setting.\",\n  \"artistic_style\": \"cyberpunk, realistic, dynamic\"\n}",
